"},{"text":"Health analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Health Policy"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy analysis"},{"text":"Health systems"},{"text":"Financing"},{"text":"Healthcare access"},{"text":"Program evaluation"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BPH / B.Sc Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Assistant / Public Health Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Program Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Program Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Program Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Director / Public Health Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Data & M&E pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health Graduate"},{"type":"h","text":"M&E Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"M&E Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"M&E Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior M&E Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Impact / Evaluation Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Policy pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"BPH / B.Sc Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Policy Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Policy Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Systems / Policy Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"The future of health-program coordination will increasingly involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-based population-risk prediction"},{"text":"Digital disease surveillance"},{"text":"Geospatial health analytics"},{"text":"Real-time public-health dashboards"},{"text":"Digital health platforms"},{"text":"Remote patient monitoring"},{"text":"Mobile health applications"},{"text":"Predictive resource allocation"},{"text":"Electronic health information systems"},{"text":"Population-health analytics"},{"text":"Digital epidemiology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future-facing combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Public Health","Program Management","Data Analytics","GIS","Digital Health","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Epidemiology"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Biostatistics"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Community Health"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Health Promotion"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Health Systems"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Health Policy"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Management"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Needs Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Program Design"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Stakeholder Management"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Resource Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Implementation"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"├── SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"├── R / Python"},{"type":"h","text":"├── GIS / QGIS"},{"type":"h","text":"└── DHIS2"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Health"},{"type":"h","text":"├── EHR/HIS"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Telehealth"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Digital Surveillance"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Health Dashboards"},{"type":"h","text":"└── AI Decision Support"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Report Writing"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Field Coordination"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Research"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Presentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand epidemiological principles."},{"text":"Conduct basic community-health assessments."},{"text":"Design a public-health intervention."},{"text":"Develop measurable program objectives and KPIs."},{"text":"Coordinate field activities and stakeholders."},{"text":"Build basic monitoring and evaluation frameworks."},{"text":"Collect, clean and analyze public-health data."},{"text":"Use Excel and Power BI effectively."},{"text":"Understand basic SQL and either R or Python."},{"text":"Use GIS for basic health mapping."},{"text":"Understand health information systems and digital-health workflows."},{"text":"Prepare professional program reports and presentations."},{"text":"Conduct basic public-health research."},{"text":"Participate in community-health projects."},{"text":"Understand program budgeting and resource allocation."},{"text":"Evaluate program outputs and outcomes."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["BPH / B.Sc Public Health","Program Assistant / Public Health Associate","Health Program Coordinator","Program Manager","Senior Program Manager / Program Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the 2026+ public-health environment, the strongest profile is a Health Program Coordinator who combines field implementation and stakeholder management with epidemiology, monitoring & evaluation, data analytics, GIS and digital-health capabilities."}]}]}